      "writtenOn": "2021-11-19T20:30:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume this class is needed because we need mtl::Caps access to the data members of sksl::ShaderCaps. One thought do we really not want to just add the friends directly in sksl::ShaderCaps?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 18,
        "startChar": 6,
